eement]**  \n- Current Buyer Offer: $13,000  \n- Current Seller Demand: $14,000  \n- Likelihood of Agreement: Low', 'continue_simulation': True, 'total_milestones': 0, 'agent_kpis': {}, 'communications': []}, {'iteration': 3, 'task_assignments': {'agent1': 'Initiate the negotiation by presenting the premium pricing of $16.98, emphasizing the unique value and quality of the product. Use clear communication and trust-building tactics to establish a foundation for further discussion.', 'agent2': "Engage with the buyer by highlighting the product's competitive advantages and justifying the premium price. Be prepared to listen to the buyer's concerns and offer a discount of up to 15% if necessary to reach a mutually beneficial agreement."}, 'task_results': [], 'summary': '{\n  "Iteration Summary": "The buyer initially offered a price of $13,000, citing market conditions. The seller countered with $14,000, emphasizing the product\'s premium features and quality. Both agents are actively using tools to justify their positions and push for their goals.",\n  \n  "Agent Actions and Tools Used": [\n    {\n      "Agent": "Buyer",\n      "Action Taken": "Offer Price",\n      "Tool Parameters": {"price": 13000, "reason": "Market data suggests the remote control is worth around $13,000."},\n      "Result": "Tool executed successfully. Offer was made and rejected by the seller."\n    },\n    {\n      "Agent": "Seller",\n      "Action Taken": "Reject and Counter",\n      "Tool Parameters": {"counter_price": 14000, "reason": "The remote control has premium features and high scalability, justifying a higher price."},\n      "Result": "Tool executed successfully. Counter offer was presented to the buyer."\n    }\n  ],\n  \n  "Key Strategies and Observations": {\n    "Buyer’s Strategy": "The buyer focused on market comparisons and cost-effectiveness to argue for a lower price.",\n    "Seller’s Strategy": "The seller emphasized the product\'s premium features and long-term value to justi